  "description": "Embrace raw urban energy, bold graffiti aesthetics, and unapologetic street attitude with this striking digital design!\nThis design features an intense, beautiful woman with blonde curly hair wrapped in a pink paisley bandana, leaning thoughtfully on her hand[cite: 14]. Styled with smudged, dripping black mascara running down her cheeks, vibrant pink lipstick, silver hoop earrings, a turquoise “X” face tattoo, and a chunky silver chain bracelet[cite: 14]. She is framed by dripping pink roses, neon cyan and magenta paint splatters, and urban graffiti quotes including “CHAOS,” “CREATE DESTROY REBUILD,” and “IT WAS ALL A DREAM”[cite: 14].\n📁 Your Download Includes:\n* 1 Premium Graphic (300 DPI, Print-Ready)\n* High-resolution file featuring a clean, transparent background\n✨ Endless Ways to Create:\n* Custom Apparel & Merchandise: Standout t-shirts, cozy hoodies, fabrics, phone cases, and tote bags\n* Physical Crafts & Prints: Stunning wall art, stickers, decals, and printable decor\n* Digital & Web Design: Eye-catching website banners, social media content, and digital graphics\n* Stationery & Planning: Notebooks, personalized planners, journals, and creative paper crafts\n* Bring any vision to life—unleash your imagination and start crafting!\n❓ QUESTIONS?\nIf you have any problems with your download or the product, please contact me anytime!",
